Subject: [PATCH] refactor(plugins): move refresh_plugins_for_new_session and
 error-classification dispatch out of plugins.py [daveey]

plugins.py is over its 2000-line target and may only shrink: the session-boundary refresh helper
lives in plugins_refresh.py, and get_plugin_error_classification moves to
plugins_error_classification.py (re-exported from plugins.py, so agent.error_classifier and its
tests resolve it unchanged).
